          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ bi män da̱ŋ bärɔw wut kɛl käp, kä bikɛ wee i̱, “Bakɔ rɔ̱ mi̱eeth kärɔ̱, kä bakɔ rɔ̱ kök bieyni, kuɛn ni nɛy, woc ni buara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luuc Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm jɔk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ bi tin ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ pith ciɛk ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä bikɛ gɔw, kä bi nɛy tin ŋot kɛ ciaaŋ kä I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ̱ liak kɛ tin ci ciɛk muun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛy tin ŋot kɛ tëk kä Dha-yɔn tin ci duɔth kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm bakɛ cɔli ti rɛ̈lkɛ rɔ̱, kɛn nɛy tin ca ciöötkiɛn gɔ̱r tin tëk kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi Kuoth Nhial jiäk nyieet Dha-yɔn lak jɔ̱ɔ̱r, kä bɛ riɛm Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm lak jɔ̱ɔ̱r rɛydɛ kɛ lukɛ yiëë mi päär kɛnɛ yiëë maac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi Kuoth Nhial päm Dha-yɔn kɛnɛ nɛy tin ca rɔ̱ dol ɛn wi̱ni kum kɛ wuɔ̱n tuɔɔl kɛ cäŋdäär, kɛnɛ bo̱l maac kɛ wäär. Bi buay Kuɔth ram ɔ kum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn kuum ɛmɔ, bɛ naath gaŋ kɛ cäŋ, kä ɛ gua̱a̱th lua̱k kä ɛ duel mi gaŋ naath kä thul kɛnɛ nhiaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
